"id":"euler.lemma-4.1","kind":"claim","label":"Lemma 4.1","locator":"Lemma 4.1, Section 4","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Lemma 4.1.** Assume $H^\\#\\le\\operatorname{Id}$ on $I\\times\\mathbb T^3$ as quadratic forms. Then for every $a\\in\\mathbb T^3$, $z\\in H^1_0(I;\\mathbb R^3)$ and $\\xi=D_aX(\\cdot,a)z$, one has $\\int_I H^\\#\\xi\\cdot\\xi\\,\\mathrm dt\\le\\frac12\\int_I|\\xi_t|^2\\,\\mathrm dt$. Hence $$\\begin{equation}\n \\int_I(Kz_t\\cdot z_t+\\Omega z_t\\cdot z)\\,\\mathrm dt\n \\ge\\frac12\\int_I|\\xi_t|^2\\,\\mathrm dt. \\tag{4.8}\n\\end{equation}$$","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/nodes/euler.lemma-4.1","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/nodes/euler.lemma-4.1","id":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-4.1%22%2C%22lean.TorusEuler.Paper.lemma_4_1%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-4.1%22%2C%22lean.TorusEuler.Paper.lemma_4_1%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/nodes/lean.TorusEuler.Paper.lemma_4_1"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/nodes/euler.theorem-4.2","id":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/edges/%5B%22euler.theorem-4.2%22%2C%22euler.lemma-4.1%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/edges/%5B%22euler.theorem-4.2%22%2C%22euler.lemma-4.1%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/node